
# Miamaya – Cypress E2E Test Automation

End-to-end test automation project for the Miamaya e-commerce website, developed using **Cypress and JavaScript**.

The project focuses on validating critical user journeys, core website functionality, and third-party integrations to ensure a reliable shopping experience.

## 🛠 Tech Stack

- **Cypress** – End-to-end test automation
- **JavaScript** – Test scripting
- **Node.js / npm** – Dependency management
- **Git & GitHub** – Version control

